#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-throw.rst:5
#: b11a6c190b1b486f9fcab1579d9b3fa6
msgid "SkyRocket Throw Mode"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-throw.rst:10
#: 26c222c7224245ffb074d128cd01f88f
msgid "The SkyViper is such a small frame that is is great for :ref:`Throw Mode <throw-mode>`. If you want to try throw mode then first read the :ref:`throw mode documentation <throw-mode>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-throw.rst:13
#: ae2e4cda70e14c6b81ca56966a54cb75
msgid "Here are some extra tips for throw mode on the SkyViper:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-throw.rst:15
#: e84c4c6c00e347e69d1b0fa88595a453
msgid "you can assign throw mode to a button on your TX. Go to the web interface at ``http://192.168.99.1`` and choose the parameters page. Then assign throw mode to one of the action buttons. I like using ACTION5, which you get by holding the MODE button, then pressing the right shoulder button (the one marked with the photo icon)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-throw.rst:20
#: 5a2a57f31acc40a88b2c488333409ff7
msgid "wait till you have full GPS lock (green LED on transmitter is solid)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-throw.rst:21
#: 5f7c8058601f42aa954ec83cef391874
msgid "with your skyviper disarmed and on the ground, select throw mode with the button you have setup in the first step. You will hear a bip-boop-bip sound from the TX"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-throw.rst:24
#: f3e34e5f1e124cdcb652e8edc99e3e28
msgid "now press the \"return\" button to arm your copter. The motors will not start spinning."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-throw.rst:26
#: a4578be145ca4b5688a0e2a998d55a49
msgid "look at your transmitter LEDs. If the green LED is flashing rapidly then you are ready to throw. Do not throw the copter unless the green LED is flashing rapidly"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-throw.rst:29
#: dc52755bfbbb43269deecb80a8f7d5b9
msgid "pickup the copter by one of the legs, keeping fingers clear of the propellers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-throw.rst:31
#: 3ef5e241a1c94d0b8e9225871ee09b8e
msgid "throw it as high as you can with one smooth motion"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-throw.rst:32
#: 10f9568bd39f40a5a0e869d2a135609e
msgid "do NOT swing your arm back and forward to \"wind up\" for the throw, otherwise the copter may think the throw has been done and will start the motors"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-throw.rst:35
#: 8e73986abd04429e8dc82ff768a8ee98
msgid "be ready to press the power button on the TX for instant disarm if something goes wrong"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-throw.rst:37
#: 6d6d7cfe2ab14e3fbd999aa9ca97f8b5
msgid "after the throw, the copter will take a few seconds to settle, then will automatically switch to LOITER mode for you to fly it"
msgstr ""
